  "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/asr-diarization",
  "sourceTitle": "Powerful ASR + diarization + speculative decoding with Hugging Face Inference Endpoints",
  "sourceBodyHash": "2c96d1e6b925a74569828c00b9ef6fb358e48351ed9d3ce5ca213b009e6dce69",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T05:54:39.373807Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T03:07:54.250626Z",
  "totalBlocks": 43,
  "translatedBlocks": 43,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd5727732ebe1941",
      "translationZh": "Whisper 是最好的开源语音识别模型之一，而且无疑是使用最广泛的一个。Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 让开箱即用地部署任意 Whisper 模型变得非常简单。不过，如果你想引入额外的功能，例如用于识别说话人的说话人分离流水线，或用于推测解码的辅助生成，事情就会变得棘手。原因在于，你需要将 Whisper 与其他模型组合起来，同时仍然只对外提供一个 API 端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cd363f4d79f6e51",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用自定义推理处理器来解决这一难题，它将在 Inference Endpoints 上实现自动语音识别（ASR）和说话人分离流水线，并支持推测解码。说话人分离流水线的实现受到了著名的 Insanely Fast Whisper 的启发，并使用 Pyannote 模型进行说话人分离。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "229e57c5da5d090a",
      "translationZh": "这也将展示 Inference Endpoints 的灵活性，以及你几乎可以在上面托管任何东西。这里提供了可供跟着操作的代码。请注意，在端点初始化期间，整个代码仓库都会被挂载，因此，如果你不想将所有逻辑都放在一个文件中，handler.py 可以引用仓库中的其他文件。在这个例子中，我们决定将内容拆分到几个文件中，以保持结构清晰：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "92f78deee9fb9127",
      "translationZh": "handler.py 包含初始化和推理代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1ee36d5fa1804240",
      "translationZh": "diarization_utils.py 包含所有与说话人分离相关的预处理和后处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c8359b46597a4df",
      "translationZh": "config.py 包含 ModelSettings 和 InferenceConfig。ModelSettings 定义流水线将使用哪些模型（你不必使用全部模型），而 InferenceConfig 定义默认推理参数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2660d3d541fedf71",
      "translationZh": "从 Pytorch 2.2 开始，SDPA 开箱即用地支持 Flash Attention 2，因此我们将使用该版本来加快推理速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ed33f274f35dbbbb",
      "translationZh": "主要模块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "210ab3c757ee17af",
      "translationZh": "下面是一张展示该端点内部工作原理的高层示意图：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0c054d6e8337334",
      "translationZh": "ASR 和说话人分离流水线采用模块化实现，以满足更广泛的用例需求——说话人分离流水线基于 ASR 的输出运行，如果不需要说话人分离，可以只使用 ASR 部分。对于说话人分离，我们建议使用 Pyannote 模型，它是目前达到最先进水平的开源实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a9e133db386698c",
      "translationZh": "我们还将加入推测解码来加速推理。其加速方式是使用一个更小、更快的模型提出候选生成内容，再由更大的模型进行验证。关于它具体如何与 Whisper 配合工作，可以阅读这篇精彩的博客文章来了解更多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7f9d1af2eac087a",
      "translationZh": "推测解码存在以下限制：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "07e1815d4c733a60",
      "translationZh": "辅助模型至少在解码器部分应与主模型具有相同的架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "82194e5286d60ba4",
      "translationZh": "批大小必须为 1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43d1a6cfc01d1643",
      "translationZh": "请务必考虑上述限制。根据你的生产环境用例，支持更大的批次可能比推测解码更快。如果你不想使用辅助模型，只需将配置中的 assistant_model 保持为 None。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3254a8116820b947",
      "translationZh": "如果你确实要使用辅助模型，那么对于 Whisper 来说，蒸馏版本是一个很好的选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ee89ef4bf26b4211",
      "translationZh": "设置你自己的端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19c3967a69b4b967",
      "translationZh": "最简单的入门方式是使用仓库复制工具克隆自定义处理程序仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d953de3441db96e2",
      "translationZh": "以下是 handler.py 中的模型加载部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e433391e10320dd9",
      "translationZh": "你可以根据自己的需求自定义流水线。config.py 文件中的 ModelSettings 保存了初始化时使用的参数，用于指定推理期间要使用的模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df4918fbaf0c0db5",
      "translationZh": "可以通过传入具有对应名称的环境变量来调整这些参数——这对自定义容器和推理处理程序都适用。这是 Pydantic 的一项功能。要在构建时向容器传入环境变量，你必须通过 API 调用创建端点（而不是通过界面）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34a6785018cda886",
      "translationZh": "你可以将模型名称硬编码，而不是通过环境变量传入，但请注意，说话人分离流水线要求显式传入令牌（hf_token）。出于安全原因，不允许将令牌硬编码，这意味着你必须通过 API 调用创建端点，才能使用说话人分离模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f44e66430f3e7747",
      "translationZh": "提醒一下，所有与说话人分离相关的预处理和后处理工具都在 diarization_utils.py 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e06ec0b3966170f",
      "translationZh": "唯一必需的组件是 ASR 模型。你也可以选择指定一个辅助模型，用于推测解码，还可以使用说话人分离模型按说话人划分转录文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fe742e8812261e7a",
      "translationZh": "在 Inference Endpoints 上部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "532f262a82c2d074",
      "translationZh": "如果你只需要 ASR 部分，可以在 config.py 中指定 asr_model/assistant_model，然后点击按钮即可部署：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af1c9c4e896b8cc4",
      "translationZh": "要向托管在 Inference Endpoints 上的容器传递环境变量，你需要使用提供的 API，以编程方式创建端点。下面是一个调用示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fbdb9fed1d35e52a",
      "translationZh": "何时使用辅助模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c36f0802a1341d5",
      "translationZh": "为了更清楚地说明何时使用辅助模型会带来好处，下面给出一项使用 k6 进行的基准测试：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90b67fe6587be841",
      "translationZh": "如你所见，当音频较短（批大小为 1）时，辅助生成会带来显著的性能提升。如果音频较长，推理过程会自动将其分块并组成批次，而由于我们之前讨论过的限制，推测解码可能反而会延长推理时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7c2cf9e74ccac243",
      "translationZh": "推理参数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9a385247a945bda",
      "translationZh": "所有推理参数都在 config.py 中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "729e34144822325d",
      "translationZh": "当然，你可以根据需要添加或移除参数。与说话人数量相关的参数会传递给说话人分离流水线，而其他参数则大多用于 ASR 流水线。sampling_rate 表示待处理音频的采样率，用于预处理；assisted 标志用于告知流水线是否使用推测解码。请记住，进行辅助生成时，batch_size 必须设置为 1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "99733344956dde48",
      "translationZh": "载荷",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "741533523940e2df",
      "translationZh": "部署完成后，将音频连同推理参数一起发送到你的推理端点，如下所示（使用 Python）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3b369037e9eee3e",
      "translationZh": "这里的 \"parameters\" 字段是一个字典，包含你希望调整的 InferenceConfig 中的所有参数。请注意，未在 InferenceConfig 中指定的参数将被忽略。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "136cdcbefffdcfb5",
      "translationZh": "也可以使用 InferenceClient（另有异步版本）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "31056c37942fe322",
      "translationZh": "回顾",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4878a09b6924437a",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客中，我们讨论了如何使用 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 搭建模块化的 ASR + 说话人分离 + 推测解码流水线。我们尽力让这条流水线易于按需配置和调整，而使用 Inference Endpoints 部署始终轻而易举！幸运的是，社区可以开放获取出色的模型和工具，我们在实现中使用了以下模型和工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0aba0e17916c0b63",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 的 Whisper 模型系列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7fbd0d21cc665078",
      "translationZh": "Pyannote 提供的说话人分离模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2467d8528a79f2c9",
      "translationZh": "Insanely Fast Whisper 仓库，这是主要的灵感来源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "735aa6c64b121a5b",
      "translationZh": "有一个代码仓库实现了相同的处理流水线，还包含服务端部分（FastAPI+Uvicorn）。如果你想进一步自定义，或者将其托管在其他地方，它可能会派上用场。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
